# zig-only
# `view.close_split` on the sole pane closes it (Rust: the last leaf's
# pane goes, no "only one split" complaint). The pty tab is painted as
# every tab is — `  <label> 󰅖 ` — so the tab reads `sleep 30 󰅖`.
ex term sleep 30
expect screen contains "sleep 30 󰅖"
expect pane sleep 30
command view.close_split
expect screen lacks "sleep 30 󰅖"
expect screen lacks "only one split"
